  "instructions": [
    "in a small saucepan, warm the heavy cream over low heat until it starts to simmer.",
    "remove the cream from the heat and let it steep for 10 minutes with the dried dill weed.",
    "strain the cream through a fine-mesh sieve into a clean bowl and discard the dill weed.",
    "stir in the creme fraiche and bonito flakes (if using).",
    "season the mixture with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "dust the bowl with flour (if using).",
    "scoop the creamy mixture into the prepared bowl and garnish with a dollop of sour cream (if using).",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
